At the annual academic meeting of Zhejiang University, the students sang the leading role, and the research results made people's brains wide open-Xinhua.com
Use the air to wash your hands, judge the disease, and accurately search for the source of smog Last night, at the opening ceremony of Zhejiang University's 2016 academic conference, a series of academic achievements were commended.
The main researchers of these results are students, the research covers the environment, machinery, energy, health care, life sciences, humanities education and other major fields, the students began with a curious idea, created many high-end inventions with application value, some of which have been awarded international awards in China.
Biosensors: Your Home Physicologist
Zhang Diming’s team, a doctoral student in the School of Biomedical Engineering, showcased a smartphone-side biosensor that is only half the size of a smartphone.
â€œYou only need to take a gentle breath, and this set of instruments can initially detect the health of the body from the gas composition you exhale.â€
Zhang Diming said that this sensor is connected to the smartphone, and after exhaling the gas, the health report will be displayed on the phone.
On the market to be able to detect the health status of the smart bracelet, the general detection is the temperature, pulse and other physical parameters.
And this set of biosensors using graphene, a new material, its target is the chemical elements, the keen "olfactory" so that it can more deeply and accurately reflect the health of the body.
Intelligent surgical lights: the doctor's high-energy eyes
In addition to smartphones, intelligent operating lights are also used in the operating room.
This invention won the silver medal at this year’s 44th International Exhibition of Inventions in Geneva, Switzerland.
Zhu Linjing and Shen Junfei's team, master's students in the School of Optoelectronic Science and Engineering, opened up new ideas in the defects of traditional surgical lamps, and invented intelligent LED surgical shadowless lamps.
â€œThe early detection and removal of many diseases is related to the lamps used in the doctor's operating room.â€
Shen Junfei said, for example, when the early examination of cancer, if the doctor can not see all the tumor tissue in time, then the cancer cells will spread.
This intelligent surgical lamp has four light plates, which enhance the difference between different tissues in light by adjusting the spectrum.
In the course of the operation, the doctor can adjust the size of the spot at any time according to surgical needs and personal habits, the degree of luminescence, spectrum, color uniformity, and filmlessness at any time.
This kind of intelligent surgical lamp has been tried in hospitals such as Shaw Hospital affiliated to Zhejiang University Medical College and Children's Hospital affiliated to Zhejiang University School of Medicine, and has received better feedback.
Last October, this invention won the first prize of the National Challenge Cup.
Wash your hands with the air: save water and cool
Ordinary people wash their hands with water, wipe some soap at best, squeezing hand sanitizers, while Li Qizhang and other students have invented a set of "air hand-washing devices".
As long as we stand on the device's sink, our weight can compress the air out.
“It’s like it’s a pinch.
Compressed air, forming fluid at the faucet, combined with water.
In this way, we can wash our hands!"
The color rendering reaction and bacterial residue experiments have proved that the effect of washing hands through this method is the same as that of ordinary hand washing methods.
This device only needs to rely on our own gravity as a drive, not only to ensure the degree of washing, but also to save 90% of the water, the whole process is completely no energy consumption, energy saving and environmental protection.
Last year, at the 2nd Global Challenge Summit, the invention stood out among many of the world’s top universities and won the only gold award.
