Popularization: First aid measures are actually emergency rescue in the event of an emergency, that is, rescue before the ambulance arrives.
As we all know, there is still a period of time when the ambulance comes after the accident, and it is this time that is the most critical time.
At this time, it is when first aid is needed.
If I really had heart disease, cerebral hemorrhage, respiratory arrest, then the window of our lives is only four minutes, gold four minutes!
So the people around you know how important first aid is!
When some of us fall, we can save him through professional knowledge, rather than standing there stupidly and unable to do anything, this feeling of helplessness is too terrible.
“In China, our official figures show that three million people die by accident every year, and the most dangerous is cardiac arrest.
In the United States, an average of 15% can be saved.
In the casino hotel in Las Vegas, seventy or eighty percent can be saved, compared with less than 1 percent in Shanghai and Beijing.”
