Inspection of well concrete module production and processing equipment Zhengzhou well wall brick module equipment introduction:
Zhengzhou Yixin is the domestic concrete inspection well module tile machine equipment, inspection of well block machinery, well wall wall module machinery professional manufacturers, from semi-automatic to fully automated production lines.
Through many years of practice and development, it now has excellent quality, mainly producing hydraulic, mobile, fully automated inspection well series of equipment and supporting devices.
Inspection well concrete module production and processing equipment Zhengzhou well wall brick module equipment assembly site:
The characteristics and advantages of Zhengzhou well wall brick module equipment:
Yixin inspects the new masonry materials for municipal underground structures such as coal, heat, water, electricity and gas.
Such as: drainage, water storage facilities of all kinds of inspection wells, rainwater outlets, ditches, septic tanks and small structures, bridge wing walls and so on.
The advantage of using a concrete module to build an inspection well is that around the upper and throes of the module are concave groove structures, and the combination of masonry forms a chain.
The shearing force of the well wall wall is far better than the masonry form of flat friction masonry.
The module is a hollow structure, the longitudinal holes after the combination of masonry are connected to each other, the lateral holes are consistent, and after the pore core is poured, the existing pouring concrete mesh structure is formed, which plays a secondary strengthening and waterproofing role.
The module has a stubble groove, and the horizontal receptacles and longitudinal interpolations increase the overall strength of the structure.
In addition, the use of concrete inspection well module masonry inspection wells, drainage wells are not easy to collapse, sinking, water leakage and other phenomena, the mechanical performance of the well wall wall module is stable, the operation is simple, and the forming size standards.
The intelligent control of the concrete inspection well module brick machine equipment is equipped with data input and output device one-button touch-type liquid crystal display to monitor the whole process of mechanical operation, so as to realize the ideal human-machine dialogue, automatic analysis ratio, density operation, safety logical control and fault diagnosis system.
The mechanical and hydraulic system adopts single-cylinder hydraulic, conveying, two-cylinder hydraulic and conveying.
The independent hydraulic integration station avoids the impact of host vibration on the hydraulic system, thereby ensuring the reliability of the hydraulic system's operation.
The concrete inspection well module brick machine equipment cloth box is lifted, the storage box door is closed, and the automatic conveying board is completed independently by the hydraulic system, so as to reduce the wear and maintenance of machinery.
The concrete inspection well module brick machine equipment adopts imported computers, electrical appliances, seals and hydraulic parts, and the comprehensive performance of the equipment is stable and reliable.
The mechanical excitation platform of the well wall wall module adopts the overall plate steel, and the countertop line is cut without welding point, so that the filler box is freely oscillated, fully reducing mechanical wear.
The mold load is reduced, the filler and the two-in-one encryption amplitude, the use of integration, full synchronization, Taiwan vibration, mold vibration, to ensure that the vibration effect is achieved.
Well wall wall module mechanical excitation machinery, computer automatic control amplitude according to the cost performance of raw materials to adjust the amplitude, no wear brake, thus prolonging the service life, reduce costs.
Well wall wall module mechanical automatic control and manual control of dual functions.
