Education: What does it take to save abducted children?
If the analogy of "there is no sale and no killing" of the famous public service slogan, then, in a good environment where there is no "abduction" demand, group prevention and group governance, the whole people's anti-abduction, so that trafficking behavior is unprofitable, the risk is large, and the cost is high, and this kind of crime will not occur repeatedly.
Recently, the Criminal Investigation Bureau of the Ministry of Public Security launched an emergency release platform for children's disappearance information developed by the Criminal Investigation Bureau of the Ministry of Public Security.
This is an Internet information platform created to establish an authoritative channel for the dissemination of information on the disappearance of children and the timely recovery of abducted children.
Hearing that this app is called "reunification", it is full of warmth.
New technical means not only the name of "literature", full of feelings, but also the proper use of informatization, practical and effective.
The primary goal is to recover the abducted children and protect their personal safety and freedom.
The second is the trial and punishment of suspects.
The significance of criminal punishment, from individual punishments, social prevention to legal education, can enumerate many "big words".
However, priority attention should be given to the personal safety of the victims until the trafficking case is solved.
Under the urgent purpose of "rescue", such as "trafficking in children should always be sentenced to death" and other controversial topics, can be temporarily put down, carefully discussed; but the rescue of abducted children and so on is not allowed.
Based on the investigative experience of such cases, traffickers are accustomed to staying away from the crime site as soon as possible.
If there is a one-minute delay in the abduction operation, the child may be further away from the parents, and the difficulty of solving the case will increase by one point.
In this case, it is indeed a pragmatic action to come up with an effective method such as "reunification" platform that directly helps to solve cases and recover children.
After all, "abduction" is a big task that needs to operate the entire legal system.
Combating crime, protecting the rights and interests of children and parents, from the improvement of legislation to the protection of the judiciary, as well as the meticulousness of law enforcement, there is no need to implement the care of "caring for children and the weak".
In addition, the prevention of child trafficking, from the family to society, can also do better.
For example, in a common case, a family of three rested at the train station, and the parents fell asleep and woke up to find that the child was missing.
It is not possible to expect that a two-year-old child will have sufficient self-protection skills, but as a parent of young children, it should have at least a considerable sense of protection.
Both parents take turns to rest, or put their children under sound protection, which is the minimum means of preventing the abduction of children.
Judging from the other side of the police's fight against trafficking crimes, the purchase of abducted children should also be paid attention to and punished.
Individual wrongdoing is often just one link in a long chain.
According to China's Criminal Law, the statutory penalty point for the crime of trafficking in children is 5 years; if the circumstances are particularly serious, it may go to the death penalty and the property is confiscated.
Under the general trend of "lightening punishment", the crime of child trafficking is obviously a more punishable crime.
However, there are still a lot of trafficking cases every year.
It can be seen that some people's concept of raising children is backward, and the legal consciousness is weak.
The legal education of this part of the people should be followed up simultaneously.
In order to effectively control trafficking crimes, it is impossible to rely solely on strict official law enforcement.
If there is a wide range of "markets" in the "market" of abductions, the interests of traffickers, the continuous innovation of the means of trafficking, and the formation of a "fight method" situation with law enforcers, the abduction action is bound to fall into an inefficiencies.
Therefore, breaking the concept of backwardness and popularizing legal common sense also help to root out the crime of trafficking and the sale of children.
Yang Haodong preached the spirit of the Sixth Plenary Session of the Nineteenth Central Committee of the Party and the Provincial Party Congress in Ma Yushan.
From the party's 100-year history of struggle to draw strength
Hunan Daily News, December 10 (all-media reporter Gong Baiwei) According to the unified arrangement of the provincial party committee, on the morning of December 10, Yang Haodong, head of the Standing Committee of the Provincial Party Committee and Propaganda Department of the Provincial Party Committee, made an interactive speech at the Ma Yueshan Video Creative Park, thoroughly studied and implemented the spirit of the Sixth Plenary Session of the 19th Central Committee of the Party, learned and implemented the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech to Hunan.
Yang Haodong, from the three aspects of ideals and beliefs and original missions, self-revolution and the big party of youth, party leaders and party theories, combined with his own understanding and personal experience, explained the core essence and practical requirements of the spirit of the plenary session in an in-depth and comprehensive and systematic manner.
He pointed out that it is necessary to combine the spirit of important instructions and instructions of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech to Hunan, the spirit of the provincial party congress, integrate and learn, and enhance the ideological consciousness, political self-consciousness, and action of defending the â€œtwo establishmentsâ€ and achieving â€œtwo maintenanceâ€, and unswervingly follow the direction guided by General Secretary Xi Jinping.
In the interactive exchange, grass-roots cadre representatives, business representatives, youth representatives on the relationship between the three historical resolutions, how to understand the decisive significance of the "two established", how to grasp the guidance of cultural enterprises, how to draw strength from the history of the party in the new era, Yang Haodong with popular language, vivid examples one by one to answer.
In 2022, the number of college graduates in Beijing is expected to reach 26,800 - Xinhua
BEIJING, Dec. 11 (Xinhua) -- The reporter learned from the video conference on employment and entrepreneurship of Beijing college graduates jointly held by the Beijing Municipal Education Commission and the Beijing Municipal Bureau of Human Resources and Social Security recently that in 2022, the number of college graduates in Beijing is expected to reach 268,000, an increase of 16,000 over last year.
The relevant person in charge of the Beijing Municipal Bureau of Human Resources and Social Security said that it will deploy the employment work of Beijing university graduates in terms of strengthening the matching of supply and demand, strengthening policy support, broadening employment channels, ensuring difficult assistance, supporting innovation and entrepreneurship, and improving service effectiveness.
The reporter learned that the Beijing Municipal Human Resources and Social Security Bureau will build a practical platform, increase job supply, take the initiative to contact 40 college graduates workplace experience base, visit employers, integrate demand information and job information; focus on "six batches", that is, broaden the recruitment of public institutions, broaden the recruitment of state-owned enterprises, broaden the recruitment of grass-roots projects, broaden the recruitment of a group, broaden the number of employment trainees, broaden the number of jobs to promote employment; the implementation of "a lifetime" dynamic management.
