On the eve of the "double twelve" of Jiexin to promote rational consumption to consumers - Economic Watch Network - Professional financial news website
This year's "double eleven" carnival national network payment business transactions amounted to 1.77 trillion yuan, compared with previous years a new high.
There are many kinds of full red envelopes, eye-catching live goods once again let consumers benefit, this consumption boom on the one hand makes people lament the increasingly strong national consumption power, on the other hand, they have to calm down and think about the impact of consumerism on society and contemporary mainstream consumer groups.
On the eve of the arrival of "Double Twelve", Jixin Consumer Finance Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as "Jixin") issued a rational consumption initiative to remind the majority of users, especially young people, to establish good consumption awareness and consumption habits, and refused to blind consumption and excessive consumption.
According to the results of the "Consumer Financial Literacy Survey and Analysis Report" released by the People's Bank of China this year, the national consumer financial literacy index was 66.81, an increase of 2.04 compared with 2019.
In general, China's residents perform well at the level of financial consumption, but in terms of different aspects of financial behavior and skills show greater differences, and it is necessary to further improve the level of basic financial knowledge.
The level of financial literacy of the elderly and teenagers is relatively low, "one old and one young" will still be the focus of financial education; Nielsen's "Report on China's Young People's Debt Status" and the "2019-2020 China Youth Consumption Report" released by CCTV Finance show that the younger generation has huge consumption potential, credit consumption has become an important way to upgrade consumption, 86.6% of young people are using credit products, nearly half of them have no debt accumulation.
As a licensed consumer financial institution, Jexin has always been committed to helping the people build their own happy lives with high-quality and intimate services, advocating consumers to establish a good and correct view of consumption, and actively responding to the call of supervision to improve the rational consumption consciousness of consumers, especially young groups with practical actions.
In the past few years, Jixin has continuously carried out all-round and diversified financial knowledge popularization activities for youth groups, including college students, and has carefully guided the consumption needs of young groups through various forms such as launching innovative practice competitions with top domestic colleges and universities, so as to help them establish a rational consumption concept, rationally plan consumer demand, and then contribute to their accumulated life wealth.
On the occasion of the arrival of Double Twelfth, Jixin reminded all consumer friends to establish a reasonable sense of consumption and the correct view of money, resist blind consumption and excessive consumption, and avoid consumption and borrowing misunderstandings, so as not to affect personal credit and future economic life.
When consuming, it must be planned in advance, and it is necessary to pay back on time.
If it is overdue, the overdue record will be recorded in the personal credit report, which may have a negative impact on economic life such as buying a car and buying a house in the future.
At the same time, when enjoying financial products and services, we should also choose formal institutions and channels, and pay attention to checking whether the relevant institutions have business qualifications.
In the future, Jixin will continue to rely on its mature and reliable consumer financial system and constantly updating iterative financial products to bring consumers more responsive needs and diversified services, continue to help the public improve the level of financial knowledge, help consumers cultivate the concept of rational consumption and moderate borrowing, and be a trusted consumer finance partner for consumers throughout their lives.
