Let the spirit of the university resonate with the spirit of the times - Xinhua.com
The so-called university spirit refers to a series of school-running concepts and value pursuits formed by a university in the process of long-term development, which is the soul of the university.
Since ancient times, the spirit of the university has been crucial to the development of politics, economy, culture, science and technology, society, and even the progress of a nation.
Since the birth of the world's first modern university, the university has shouldered the unique mission of different from other social organizations, for China's universities, rising in the autumn of national distress, its spirit is deeply influenced by the traditional culture and the changes of the times, advocating the value concept of "Ming Deji, Xiu Qixianping" and the patriotic responsibility of "learning a strong country".
At present, the trend of informatization and internationalization of higher education has become increasingly obvious, education competition, scientific and technological competition, and talent competition on a global scale have been intensifying, and higher education has become an important "supply side", and its structural reform is facing unprecedented opportunities and challenges.
In particular, the overall plan for comprehensively promoting the construction of world-class universities and first-class disciplines, while demonstrating China's confidence and determination to move from a big country of higher education to a strong country in higher education, puts forward higher and newer requirements for the development of universities.
How to work hard in a relatively short period of time among the world's first-class ranks, on the basis of there is still a certain gap to accelerate the construction of a number of world-class universities and a number of world-class disciplines, to achieve "curve overtaking"?
In addition to strengthen the goal of self-confidence, path self-confidence, ability and self-confidence, colleges and universities should also give full play to three advantages: first, through the continuous introduction of overseas outstanding academic talents, learn from the advanced experience of the world's first-class universities, to achieve a significant improvement in the academic level and the quality of running schools; the other is the cultural advantages, inheriting the wisdom connotation of Chinese civilization in five thousand years, promoting the development of excellent traditional culture, in order to unite, shape the brand, enhance the image;
In particular, it is necessary to realize that it is impossible to build a world-class university, and each school must highlight its personality and characteristics while giving play to its advantages.
The characteristics of running schools should not only have common Chinese characteristics, but also reflect their unique target positioning, school tradition and resource endowment.
As far as Zhejiang University is concerned, we pay attention to highlighting the characteristics of three aspects in running schools: one is to highlight the characteristics of innovation and entrepreneurship talent training, build an integrated education environment of scientific and educational integration and the combination of schools and enterprises, and form a full-chain entrepreneurial education ecosystem; second, highlight the characteristics of interdisciplinary convergence, promote the optimization and adjustment of the discipline system, create an interdisciplinary institutional environment, actively cultivate interdisciplinary disciplines and iconic interdisciplinary achievements; third, highlight the characteristics of running schools and social services.
In this process, it is particularly important that we must always adhere to the spirit of the university, so that the spirit of the university resonates with the spirit of the times.
For Zhejiang University, the common values of â€œindustrious learning, cultivation, discernment, and solidityâ€ and â€œHaina River, Qian Zhen virtue, the people before the opening of things, and the state of our countryâ€ jointly constitute the latest expression system of the spirit of Zhejiang University.
This is an important guarantee for the school to adhere to the correct direction of running the school, constantly accumulating cultural heights and gathering spiritual strength, which is rich in content and far-reaching.
Among them, "Haina River" emphasizes the spirit of openness and inclusiveness, reflected in the "the world's talents for my use" mind, reflected in drawing on the world's famous schools to educate people's high-quality concept; "Qi Zhen Houde" emphasizes the spirit of seeking truth and goodness, refers to the university in the pursuit of the truth at the same time, but also to accept the virtue of the cultivation and personality of the people.
This series of spiritual concepts and value pursuits is the soul of Zhejiang University's 120-year-old school.
"He who hears is silent, and he who is wise is invisible."
Chinese universities should further base themselves on the overall cause of socialism with Chinese characteristics, deeply grasp the orientation of the era and the historical mission of the cause of higher education, and accelerate the construction of world-class universities.
At the same time, adhering to humanistic care and independent freedom, so that the spirit of the university and the spirit of the times and the spirit of the nation stir each other, so as to provide an inexhaustible impetus for the realization of national prosperity and national rejuvenation and the realization of the common ideals of mankind.
