"Axie Infinity" is a pet development game based on blockchain technology, a collection of NFT, including a variety of gameplay, is currently the highest turnover of NFT projects, so far more than $3 billion.
TokenTerminal data shows that Axie Infinity earns more than $8.2 million a day, which is directed to the glory of the king.
