The initial registration of the first-level cost, the problem of continuing education, have you encountered it?
Re-registration shall provide proof of continuing education of not less than 30 school hours for nearly a year Re-registration shall provide proof of continuing education of not less than 120 school hours for nearly 4 years Re-registration Re-registration shall provide proof of continuing education of not less than 30 hours per full year
The cost engineer's continuing education cost standard
Cost engineers participating in online continuing education are required to pay learning fees to the governing bodies at the time of registration, and the general standard is that the cost of compulsory courses for 30 hours is 300 yuan / person year (including unified teaching materials for continuing education);
The cost of 30 hours of electives is 300 yuan / person year.
Compulsory 30-hour courses and 30-hour electives cost $600 / person year (including continuing education unified teaching materials).
(A) to participate in the association or provincial and departmental management agencies of the registered cost engineer network continuing education learning, according to the online learning course records of the time to calculate the study time;
(B) to participate in the middle price association or provincial and departmental management organizations of the registered cost of engineers focused on face-to-face training and various types of training courses, seminars, etc., every half day can be identified for 4 hours;
(C) to participate in the middle price association, the provincial and departmental cost engineers, the cost staff to continue education teaching, every half a day can be identified as 10 hours;
(4) Participate in the study of medium-priced and provincial-level research, the preparation of industry standards, and the preparation of teaching materials, each of which is identified as 30 hours per year;
(6) Participate in the preparation of the national cost engineer qualification examination materials and propositions, review questions and assessments, which can be recognized as 30 hours per year;
(7) professional papers and works related to the cost of the project that are signed by the individual and published publicly (based on the official publication number).
Publication of a book for every 10,000 words identified as 12 credit hours;
Publish papers in national-level journals for 8 years per thousand words, publish papers in provincial-level journals for 5 years per thousand words, and publish papers in municipal journals for every thousand words for 3 years;
(9) Participate in the open training of project cost consulting enterprises approved or authorized by the China Price Association, various provincial and departmental management institutions, provincial cost associations (except for general management and skills training of enterprises), which can be determined by 4 school hours every half day, and can be determined up to 30 hours per year.
Cost Engineer Network Continuing Education Learning Process
After the registrar receives the fee, the student's identity is immediately opened, and the cost engineer can enter the online education classroom with a username and password.
Students learn through on-demand courseware, question-and-answer questions, and online discussions.
If you forget the password, the username and password are not correct at the time of login, you can not log in to learn, please contact the registrant, the registrar can help modify the student's password (but can not modify the user name), using its modified password to re-land.
