Whyphonies on Red Whiskes?
Everyone's hobbies are different, some people like to collect, some people like food, of course, some people like wine tasting, red whiskey is one of the best-selling Scotch Whiskies in various countries, and red whiskey has won the gold medal in the international wine competition.
Every bottle of red whiskey has a unique taste, but if you don't know how to taste it, it won't spoil it.
How do you drink red whiskey? 🙂
A brief introduction for everyone.
Red Whisky Drinks:
With about 35 kinds of Scotch whisky blended in, Zunny added red-plated whiskey, it has the characteristics of fragrant and traditional Scotch whisky, with a sweet and smoky aroma.
The entrance is fresh and fresh, with a slight smell of vanilla and strong smoky malts.
The wine can be consumed directly with ice, or mixed with a favorite drink.
In order to adapt to the tastes of the country, sparkling drinks such as red whiskey + Coke or Sprite or Novelties have become an enduring fashion.
These sweet drinks, in addition to neutralize the sour taste, can visually bring pleasure to people, add drinks, and play the effect of diluted wine to change the taste.
Red brand whiskey + sliced lemon + square sugar (sand sugar can also), is the most authentic, the most traditional way to drink.
Authentic red Fangwei tastes somewhat sour, adding sugar can neutralize the sour taste, lemon will bring a fresh aroma to the wine, of course, sweet acidity can be blended according to personal taste preferences.
The above three are the best way to drink red whiskey, we can use it as a reference to try, I hope that the introduction of the small series can help everyone.
Educational thinking: how to make the university examination "student hegemony" and "slag" get their own place-Xinhua.com
The three students of Lanzhou Jiaotong University wrote a letter to the leadership of the university, reflecting the confusion of the university examination, and proposed to improve the difficulty of the examination, change the type of the exam, so that the exam can truly reflect the demands of the actual level of the students.
Indeed, for a long time, university exams have been a "hot topic".
On the university campus, students come from all over the world, and the level of ability is different, coupled with different levels of learning, and the situation of learning varies widely.
It is inevitable that there will be different feelings for groups with such multiple characteristics.
Of course, if the test questions are single and the repetition rate is high, and the questions are too simple, it will inevitably lead to another very different feeling.
Students who don't work hard, they may be able to pass before the test, and if they think of other methods, it is possible to achieve a multiplier effect.
In this way, there will be "slag" usually no investment can pass, or even get a high score; "study hegemony" usually never dropped classes, homework, notes are as good, the exam is not much higher than the "strange status quo".
In this way, the students of Lanzhou Jiaotong University reflect that there are problems in the university examination is not without reason, and I believe that this situation is not only the existence of Lanzhou Jiaotong University.
In this sense, it is necessary to praise these three students who wrote directly.
In fact, people who have been to the university are clear that it is not uncommon for people who have gone to the university to prepare for the exam and think of various ways to "arbitrage" from the teacher's position, strive to draw the scope of the exam, and get the phenomenon of "key tutoring" before getting the exam, and it is not uncommon even in the exam.
In my opinion, as a teaching quality assessment orientation, measuring the qualification of a university examination lies in the teacher's comprehensive grasp of teaching and learning, as well as scientific propositions on this basis.
Entering the undergraduate level of the university, the major began to be subdivided, and many professional courses were based on basic knowledge.
Undoubtedly, whether to fully grasp the basic knowledge points of a discipline is the content to be examined by the university examination.
The undergraduate knowledge is basically the basic theory of the discipline and basic common sense, from the point of view of knowledge, the space for change is not large, basically fixed.
As some teachers said, "20 years ago to learn the basics of mathematics in the university, is still studying, or the focus."
However, the knowledge point is basically unchanged, and it does not mean that there is a single type of test question and the test question is repeated.
In many universities, the exam will generally form a problem group, and then the senior teachers of the discipline to form the overall composition of the test paper, the examination paper is also covered by all the teachers responsible, so that to a certain extent to overcome the duplication of test questions.
However, it is necessary to develop a set of test questions in line with the actual teaching and learning, according to the overall situation of the student's learning, it is difficult and easy to show the normal distribution, it is also necessary to comprehensively grasp the teaching situation and comprehensively analyze the degree of students' learning, so that the examination proposition can have a dynamic grasp of the difficulty and the problem type, both to highlight the basic knowledge investigation, but also to take into account the ability to investigate, and at the same time.
The examination is the baton of university education, what kind of examination, students will have the corresponding test preparation program, in the long run, will affect the effectiveness of university education.
For the student's proposal letter, Lanzhou Jiaotong University attaches great importance to it and has deployed rectification programs throughout the university.
All teaching units are required to organize teachers to carry out seminars and course completion examinations against self-examination, formulate examination paper propositions and related systems, and strengthen the supervision and inspection of examination paper propositions and audit links, refine performance evaluation, and strengthen the comprehensive assessment of all aspects of curriculum teaching.
From the mechanism to solve a single type of test questions, repeated questions and other issues are the topics that the university examination needs to face, of course, it is necessary to introduce the corresponding system, but kung fu is expensive in the day-to-day, it is necessary for teachers to fully grasp the teaching situation, not only to eat through the teaching content, but also to eat through the learning situation of the students.
