People's Daily Commentator: "14th Five-Year Plan" to achieve a good start - On learning and implementing the spirit of the Central Economic Work Conference - Xinhua.com
BEIJING, Dec. 11 (Xinhua) -- People's Daily December 12 commentator's article: "14th Five-Year Plan" to achieve a good start - on learning and implementing the spirit of the Central Economic Work Conference
"To achieve a good start of the 14th Five-Year Plan", the Central Economic Work Conference held from December 8th to 10th spoke highly of the achievements of China's economic and social development in the past year.
General Secretary Xi Jinping delivered an important speech at the meeting, profoundly summarized the economic work in 2021, thoroughly analyzed the current economic situation, made a major deployment of economic work in 2022, did a good job in economic work for us next year, ushered in the convening of the party's 20 major victories, pointed out the way forward and provided fundamental follow-up.
We solemnly celebrated the centenary of the founding of the Communist Party of China, officially announced the completion of a well-off society in an all-round way, achieved the goal of the first hundred years of struggle, and embarked on a new journey of building a socialist modern country in an all-round way and marching towards the goal of the second century of struggle.
We convened the Sixth Plenary Session of the Nineteenth Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, summed up the major achievements and historical experience of the Party's 100-year struggle, and adopted the Resolution of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China on the Major Achievements and Historical Experiences of the Party's Centenary Struggle in Centenary History, which is a political declaration for the Chinese Communists in the new era to keep in mind their original mission, adhere to and develop socialism with Chinese characteristics.
In the past year, the world's major changes that have not occurred in a hundred years and the global pandemic of the new crown pneumonia epidemic have been intertwined, the external environment has become more complex and severe, and the tasks of prevention and control of the domestic new crown pneumonia epidemic and economic and social development have been extremely heavy and arduous.
With Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, the Party Central Committee adheres to the overall situation at home and abroad, adheres to the general tone of steady progress, calmly responds to the 100-year changes and the epidemic of the century, coordinates epidemic prevention and control and economic and social development, accelerates the construction of a new development pattern, strengthens cross-cyclical adjustment of macro policies, focuses on promoting sustained and healthy economic development, focuses on deepening reform and opening up and innovation, and strives to complete the arduous tasks of reform and development.
The "14th Five-Year Plan" achieves a good start, and an important aspect is reflected in building a new development pattern and taking new steps, and high-quality development has achieved new results.
China's economic development and epidemic prevention and control have maintained a leading position in the world, the characteristics of strong development resilience, great potential, and sufficient momentum have continued to emerge; national strategic scientific and technological forces have accelerated growth, major innovative achievements have competed, scientific and technological innovation capabilities have been continuously improved, key core technologies have achieved new breakthroughs; the resilience of the industrial chain has been improved, foreign trade volume has increased, and the structure has continued to be optimized.
These achievements are the result of the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, the result of Xi Jinping's ideological and scientific guidance on socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era, and the result of the joint efforts and hard struggle of the people of all ethnic groups in the whole Party and the country.
Practice has once again proved that the party has established the core of Comrade Xi Jinping's Party Central Committee and the core position of the whole party, and established the guiding position of Xi Jinping's socialist ideology with Chinese characteristics in the new era, which is of decisive significance to the development of the party and the state in the new era and to the historical process of promoting the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
General Secretary Xi Jinping, as the core of the Party Central Committee and the core of the whole Party, with Xi Jinping's ideological and scientific guidance on socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era, and the unity and tenacious struggle of the people of all ethnic groups in the whole party and the country, we will surely be able to overcome all kinds of difficulties and obstacles, and create a new era of glory and create a new historical cause on the new journey of building a socialist modern country in an all-round way.
There will be the 20th National Congress of the Party next year, which is a major event in the political life of the party and the country.
Carry forward the spirit of great party building, adhere to the general tone of steady progress, complete, accurate and comprehensive implementation of the new development concept, accelerate the construction of a new development pattern, comprehensively deepen reform and opening up, adhere to innovation-driven development, promote high-quality development, adhere to the supply-side structural reform as the main line, coordinate epidemic prevention and control and economic and social development, overall development and security, continue to do a good job of "six stability" and "six guarantees".
Let us unite more closely around the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, enhance the â€œfour consciousnessesâ€, strengthen the â€œfour self-confidencesâ€, achieve â€œtwo maintenancesâ€, continuously improve political judgment, political understanding, and political execution, and implement the decision-making and deployment of the Party Central Committee with practical actions, and constantly push forward the cause of socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era.
