President of the Bosnia and Herzegovina Olympic Committee: I firmly believe that China has the ability to run the Winter Olympic Games in a special period - Xinhua
Sarajevo, Dec. 11 (Xinhua) -- President of the Bosnia and Herzegovina Olympic Committee Kvesic said recently that Poland is looking forward to the Beijing Winter Olympics and firmly believes that China has the ability to run the Winter Olympic Games in special times.
A few days ago, the Chinese Ambassador to Bosnia and Herzegovina Ji Ping met with the President of the Bosnia and Herzegovina Olympic Committee at the Sarajevo Olympic Center.
During the meeting, Kwesic commented positively on Bo-China relations and said that when he visited China on the occasion of the 2008 Beijing Summer Olympics, he was extremely impressed by China's outstanding organizational work, and firmly believed that China had the ability to run the Winter Olympics in a special period; the party looked forward to the Beijing Winter Olympics, and the Bosnia and Herzegovina Olympic Committee was actively organizing its participation; and the party hoped to take this as an opportunity to carry out more extensive exchanges and cooperation with China in the field of sports.
Ji Ping said that the two countries have a special "Olympic bond".
The 1984 Sarajevo Winter Olympics have been successfully held here, and in another two months, the 2022 Beijing Winter Olympics will also kick off, which will present a simple, safe and wonderful event to the world.
Looking forward to deepening exchanges and cooperation between the two countries in the preparation of winter sports events and the training of athletes, the Chinese Embassy in Bosnia and Herzegovina is willing to continue to play a bridging role, take the Beijing Winter Olympics as an opportunity to promote people-to-people and cultural exchanges between the two countries, so that the two peoples can "go to the future together", and wish Bosnia and Herzegovina athletes good results in Beijing.
Prior to the meeting, the Bosnia and Herzegovina Olympic Committee held the "10th Athletes of the Year" award ceremony, and Ji Ping, as a special guest, presented awards for the best young athletes in Bosnia and Herzegovina.
At the event, the publicity video of the Beijing Winter Olympics was circulated.
