48-hour negative nucleic acid, set up a "buffer zone" State Council joint prevention and joint control mechanism issued a document to strengthen the prevention and control of the epidemic in port cities-Xinhua
BEIJING, Dec. 11 (Xinhua) -- (Reporter Dong Ruifeng and Gu Tiancheng) The joint prevention and control mechanism of the State Council recently issued a notice on strengthening the prevention and control of the new crown pneumonia epidemic in port cities, requiring personnel who have recently left land border port cities (except those connected to ports in Hong Kong and Macao) need to hold a negative nucleic acid test certificate within 48 hours, and at least one nucleic acid test will be carried out after the arrival of people in land border ports.
According to the notice, the time frame of the above requirements is from the date from which the provinces, regions and cities determine the scope of the port city and announce it until March 15, 2022.
In addition, the notice also proposed that conditional port cities can study the establishment of epidemic prevention and control buffer zones in their jurisdictions.
According to the relevant person in charge of the Disease Prevention and Control Bureau of the National Health and Health Commission, for some port cities, cross-border border trade is the main pillar of the local economy, and the border people of the two sides have frequent exchanges.
The implementation of zoning differentiated management policies, from a prevention and control spillover line into two lines of defense, is expected to realize the threshold forward, reduce the risk of epidemic leakage, and achieve the greatest results of epidemic prevention and control with minimal social impact and minimum social costs.
Recently, there have been a number of local agglomeration epidemics in China, all of which have been imported by overseas epidemics through port cities.
The above notice pointed out that this exposes that some local epidemic monitoring and early warning are not timely, the closed-loop management of high-risk positions is not implemented, regular nucleic acid detection flows in form, all aspects of cold chain items are not in place, the management of centralized isolation places is not standardized, and the emergency treatment of the epidemic is not scientific and accurate enough.
The notice requires efforts to improve the epidemic prevention and control mechanism of port cities, improve the epidemic monitoring and early warning system, and implement border control measures, accelerate the completion of the shortcomings and weaknesses in the prevention and control of port cities, do not relax, scientifically and accurately do a good job of prevention and control, and weave a tight line of external defense.
The notice stressed that all port cities should study and deploy the prevention and control of the epidemic and people's livelihood protection simultaneously, publish and unblock the hotline for people's livelihood protection, regularly check the hidden dangers in terms of the supply and price of basic living materials, and solve and actively respond to outstanding problems reflected by the masses in a timely manner.
According to the notice, the port cities referred to therein include the counties (cities, districts, flags) where the air ports are located, the cities (countries, states, allies) and the municipalities directly under the Central Government, and the specific scope is determined by the provinces (autonomous regions and municipalities directly under the Central Government) according to the needs of epidemic prevention and control and announced in a timely manner.
