Inadvertently saw the following article, from the perspective of the business and the perspective of the preservation period to explain why this customer wants the bonded area inside the logistics company to do canning, although the canning belongs to deep processing, does not belong to the business scope of the bonded logistics company, here the following text may explain why customers want to do this?
I went to a lot of milk powder manufacturers and came into contact with a lot of milk powder production lines.
In fact, the raw materials of bagged milk powder are exactly the same, and there is no difference.
So you will certainly ask: Why is the shelf life one year, and the shelf life is two years or longer?
Or ask again: why is the price difference between listening and bagged clothes so large?
In fact, from this point, many consumers, or mother-level people think that because the raw materials are different, the quality will be much better.
In fact, raw materials are the same, but everyone thinks that expensive is good.
There are also consumers out of this mentality after eating the reaction and said that the taste or taste of listening is not the same!
Now let’s talk to you first about the reason why it’s expensive, where’s it expensive?
Why is the difference between their raw materials and their prices so great?
Because most of the manufacturers in the pricing are taking into account that if the bagging price is too high, it is difficult for consumers to accept, which means that the profit generated by the manufacturer is very low, or there is no profit, so what does the manufacturer rely on to survive?
Therefore, they have a big increase in the pricing of listening clothes to protect their profit margins.
Therefore, most manufacturers mainly promote listening, rather than bagged.
And you want so many manufacturers annual advertising costs tens of millions or even hundreds of millions of dollars, where does this cost come about?
As you can imagine.
Then with the development of the society, the promotion costs of the market, such as: the promotion personnel of the mall, the display cost of the mall, the cost of the gift of the product, the cost of advertising, etc. are also increasing.
Therefore, various manufacturers are also constantly adding new products, but also listening, its price is also constantly rising, in fact, this is with the increase of market costs and new products.
The main purpose is to obtain higher profits, in fact, their raw materials increase the cost at most not more than 3-4 yuan.
There are also some brands, in order to promote their own products, unscrupulous means, linked to the doctors in the hospital, by them to assist in the promotion of products, from 30 yuan to 80 yuan of profits.
And China's relevant laws absolutely do not allow such methods of operation, in fact, this approach is harming consumers.
It is recommended that you have a jar at home under the premise of buying bags of milk powder into the tank, which can save costs, and increase the preservation and sealing of milk powder, there is no impact on children.
And we don't think that the shelf life is longer than the bag, if the shelf life is the same as that after opening the bag, it's not easy to save after the bag is open, and it's easy to be spoiled.
