Most girls will suddenly experience their first holiday one day between the ages of 13 and 15 years old, and close their menstruation around the age of 50.
After that, under the premise of being healthy, it will come more regularly once a month.
However, it is not regular enough to be accurately predicted, about a week of tolerance, you need to prepare in advance, and sometimes bad luck will roll over (suddenly a few days in advance).
The length of time, the amount of blood, the degree of dysmenorrhea varies from person to person, some people for three days, some people for a week; some people flow less, some people have a lot of bloody collapse; some people have no reaction, some people have no pain to the ambulance, the pain will change with time.
Menstruation is uncontrollable, bleeding 24 hours a few days between the beginning and the end, and all you can do is use a sanitary napkin or tampon to prevent the flow of blood into the chair.
Menstruation is mainly due to the secretion of prostaglandins, and it is useless to eat ibuprofen at the beginning of the physiological period when it is not in time for dysmenorrhea to effectively relieve the pain of the month.
It is easy to pull the stomach before the physiological period due to excessive release of uterine congestion and prostaglandine.
If it is likely to arrive at the cycle, inexplicably, it will basically menstruate within two days.
It is best to replace the sanitary napkin once in two or three hours, otherwise it is easy to breed bacteria, remove the sleep time, the worst case is to replace it 6 times a day, 7 days a month, that is 42 tablets, if you add the part prepared in advance may have 50 pieces, not use one piece per month.
(Changed here, tampons do not have to change often, about five or six hours can be changed once, the longest eight hours)
Menstrual hormones may be more irritable, ovulation period will also be because of hormonal changes in the body mood instability, is very unlucky, the by the by the body to make a trip.
However, the official crime rate data shows that women's ability to control their emotions is still very high, and they do not make excuses for emotional problems.
The flow is not just about the blood, it contains the lining of the uterus that falls off.
At the end of menstruation, the endometrium is the thinnest, and then slowly become thicker, it can be understood that the uterus is the house, every month to build a house (the lining becomes thicker) ready to meet the guests, the guests did not come, all demolished (menstrual discharge) next month to build a new house.
Menstruation is very inconvenient, for decades, every few days and 24 hours of bleeding, but also abdominal pain, who wants?
However, people can be born because his mother came to menstruate, menstruation is to prepare you to live in a house for 10 months when you first came to this world, and everyone wants to thank their mother's regular and healthy menstruation.
