Is it leaking electricity to soak your feet?
Choosing the right foot tub can play a good role in foot therapy and health care, and today's U.S. series will provide answers to this question, hoping to help friends.
With the enhancement of people's awareness of health care, the foot tub is more and more loved by consumers, and a large number of different grades of products have emerged in the market, ranging from more than 100 yuan to thousands of thousands of dollars, giving consumers a lot of room for choice.
On the surface of relevant data, compared with traditional home appliances, the sales of health appliances such as foot tubs are hot, but there is no special industry standard for foot tubs, so there are certain safety hazards.
“It’s too dangerous to soak your feet in electric water.”
Mr. Li told reporters that recently, he bought a foot tub for his father to make a birthday gift, but when his father soaked his feet, he felt his feet tingled.
Mr. Li initially thought that it was caused by the vibration function of the bathtub, and he did not expect to turn off the vibration function, and his father still felt that the soles of his feet were hemp.
Mr. Li tried with an electric pen, and the pen actually lit up, and Mr. Li was surprised to find that he was actually charged in the water of the foot bath.
Later, he contacted the business, the attitude of the business is good, despite the withdrawal of the bathtub, Mr. Li is still unhappy.
Because he found that this long-popular foot basin now does not have a clear and detailed industry regulation in terms of the setting of the highest temperature, what kind of population is suitable, and what kind of materials are guaranteed to be harmless.
However, under normal circumstances, there will be no charged problems in the foot tub, but it is not excluded that a small number of products are not strictly checked when leaving the factory.
Therefore, in the time of purchase, choose a split foot tub.
Hydropower is separated and there are no safety hazards.
At the same time, you can just take a laptop test.
