Thank you very much for choosing our product, before you use our chip, please take 5 minutes to carefully read the following:
Please check that the goods are complete after unboxing.
If there is a deficiency, please contact the customer service in time.
The microfluidic chip cover plate is PC material, please do not enter the solvent that chemically reacts with the PC.
Don't use the hand push syringe to sample the chip directly, otherwise it is prone to leakage.
The microfluidic chips of the ordinary substrate are tested with pure water at 500 mbar (100 um channel depth) or 300 mbar (50um channel depth) before shipment.
The glass base chip passes the pure water test at 800 mbar (100 um channel) injection pressure before delivery, and you should be careful not to collide with sharp objects in the process of using the glass substrate chip, otherwise it will damage the substrate.
In the process of use, please combine the viscosity of the solution and do not exceed this range, otherwise it will cause leakage.
The microfluidic microchip of the ordinary basal is set below 150ul/min for the injection pump using pure water intake conditions, and the oil phase flow rate is recommended to be below 50ul/min.
Please increase your flow velocity parameter values from slow to fast, based on a comprehensive combination of viscosity of the actual intake liquid.
After the general-purpose chip is completed by the experiment, please clean the internal channels in time, otherwise it is easy to cause blockages.
Microfluidic chips are consumables and cannot be reused for a long time.
If due to long-term use or improper operation, the damage of the chip will not be replaced.
If you need a microfluidic chip that can withstand more pressure or flow velocity, you can contact customer service to customize it.
The normal delivery cycle of the chip is less than 1 week, and the inventory can be shipped 24 hours after shooting, please order with customer service consultation.
If you have questions about how to connect our chips to the sample system, you can refer to the following link https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/60474873, or search for more help on the "Message" public number.
You can also visit our official website (http://www.mesobiosys.com) to download the brochure for access to all of our products.
If you want to learn more about our products, please contact online customer service.
