Small Umbrella to buy insurance, is it reliable?
Little Umbrella is an internet insurance brokerage platform.
Judging from the settings: according to the "Regulations on the Supervision of Insurance Brokers (revised in 2015)", to become an insurance brokerage company, it is necessary to meet three key words: shareholders and promoters have no major illegal records in the last three years, and the minimum limit of 50 million yuan can be established, and they must be approved by the China Insurance Regulatory Commission.
These three are actually very harsh, summed up is to have the strength, through the CBRC (regulation of the national insurance companies, banks) of the national authority approval, shareholders to have a good style, as an insurance brokerage company's small umbrella insurance, the insurers do not have too much to question the small umbrella insurance is normal or not, after all, there are these three thresholds, not any insurance company can achieve.
It’s good at that, it’s trustworthy.
From the point of view of insurance products: small umbrella insurance is an insurance supermarket, many of the company's star serious illness insurance is sold on this platform, such as the latest on the shelves and Thai Super Mary No. 5 serious illness insurance, claims and insurers are Thai life, small Umbrella insurance is only a third-party intermediary, do not question its reliableness.
Judging from the payment model: the products of the Internet platform, because of the lack of operating expenses of business outlets and the cost of the wages of employees, Internet products are generally more cost-effective, and the payment method is flexible, supporting monthly payment, reducing the payment pressure of policyholders, and at the same time can maximize the leverage of insurance.
That's still very good.
can be considered.
From the perspective of salesman professionalism: this is particularly important, because insurance is an industry with very strong professional requirements, many Internet product customers can insure themselves, there will be a lot of misunderstandings, in terms of health notification and occupation, non-insurance practitioners will often add their own subjective consciousness when insured, feel healthy or meet, so there are a lot of hidden claims, there may be the risk of being rejected.
I myself have done insurance telephone sales in "Tencent microinsurance" (like a small umbrella, but also an Internet insurance brokerage platform), and told everyone very responsiblely.
The insurance of the Internet is real and reliable, it is not reliable people, there are no professional practitioners in the Internet channel, and there are a lot of misleading sales.
For example: 1 yuan insurance insurance 6 million, buy insurance to send mobile phones, free to receive 60,000 serious insurance premiums, these marketing strategies are not wrong, but avoid the weight is light, will not tell the insured, the first month of 1 yuan, the next month is required according to the normal charges, dozens to 200, many customers charge a year or two of their own to buy what is not clear.
I think you can spend 1 dollar, and the insurance company pays 6 million peies.
The free mobile phone is sent by the policy tail number such as 6666,8888, and if the winning text message is sent, it will not be redeemed, and no one is reminded.
(This is also a pit for policyholders, it is also a pit) free to receive 60,000 serious insurance, it is short-term, if you rely only on this, there is no other business insurance, in case there is a serious illness, 60,000 can do, can not solve the problem, the later life began to run naked.
At present, for the misleading sales of Internet insurance, the state is also cracking down.
Therefore, overall, the platform is no problem, there is no problem with the product, and the problem is the professionalism of the salesman and professional ethics.
In fact, many offline insurance brokerage companies have a wider range of products, customers can choose more opportunities and more products, and some products are also better than Internet products.
I have helped 59 Internet customers, underwriting offline products, and saving 2000-3000 yuan / year for everyone.
If you have any doubts, you are welcome to communicate and communicate with me.
I: Mingya insurance broker, has 3 years of enterprise management training experience, served more than a thousand enterprise users, cooperation with more than 100 insurance companies, before insurance, I will start from the customer's needs, tailor-made insurance products for customers, insurance, for customers around, try to strive for the best insurance results for customers, after insurance, for customers to do insurance policy finishing, policy hosting, let customers rest assured.
Live with every customer.
I hope that my answer will be helpful!
According to the definition of the insurance regulatory department, Internet insurance is the insurance business of the policyholder after clicking on the insurance link, and can independently complete the insurance business of all the insurance processes.
In this process, the policyholder does not need a signature, the insurance consultant does not need a signature, and all the steps can be completed by the policyholder.
Although the insurance of Internet insurance does not have too much a "ceremonial feeling", it may even not even have a printed version of the paper contract, but this does not affect the validity and legal effect of the electronic version of the contract.
This model is somewhat similar to the "phone sales" general assembly line operation, but there will also be a fatal problem to buy insurance, which is that subsequent services may not keep up.
Insurance is usually a long-term contract for several decades, when we buy insurance, should we seriously consider whether we choose this "intermediator", whether it is a "insurance intermediary" who can accompany us for a long time and provide services to us for many years?
