Việt Nam's Prime Minister Pham Minh Attends the 3rd Vietnam National Digital Technology Enterprise Development Forum
During the 3rd Vietnam National Digital Technology Enterprise Development Forum, two major meetings were held to discuss the two main themes of digital technology enterprises and the digital transformation of the country, digital technology enterprises and economic recovery and development during and after the new crown pneumonia epidemic.
The Minister of Communications and Communications, Nguyen Meng Hung, said that in 2021, although the new crown pneumonia epidemic continues to spread, the number and operating income of digital technology enterprises in Vietnam have maintained their growth momentum, reaching nearly 10%.
In 2021, the number of typical digital products cultivated in Vietnam focused on solving the major problems faced by Vietnam, many digital products have gone abroad, and Vietnam's digital technology ranking has been improved.
Prime Minister Nguyễễễễễn called on digital technology enterprises to assume the responsibility of developing the country's digital transformation platform, and to assume the task of developing digital platforms in these countries is to assume the national mission.
At the forum, leaders of various departments and state organs, enterprises, organizations and individuals who are studying, developing, applying and transferring digital technologies, have shared breakthrough ideas and solutions for mobilizing and pooling the resources of the whole society to develop Vietnamese technology enterprises, working together to promote the country's digital transformation and the post-epidemic economic recovery.
In his speech at the forum, Prime Minister Fan Mingzheng stressed that digital transformation is the only way for the world and an objective need for development.
Digital transformation has become a global problem, and digital transformation serves all people, so there is a need to mobilize national participation.
People and enterprises are the core, subject, goal and driving force of digital transformation.
Therefore, all policies need to be for the sake of the people and enterprises.
Prime Minister Fan Mingzheng stressed that digital transformation needs to reflect the national spirit, which needs internal strength, strategic, long-term and decisive factors, and external forces are important and breakthroughs.
At the same time, he believes that digital transformation needs to drive in-depth development and sustainable development, participate in the prevention and control of the new crown pneumonia epidemic, economic recovery and development, respond to subsequent changes, overcome the depletion of natural resources, and help the green transformation and development of green energy.
Digital transformation needs to participate in the establishment of databases to protect and carry forward the cultural values, historical traditions, national customs and customs of relevant countries, and to promote digital transformation in the fields of banking, taxation, land management and development databases and logistics.
The biggest goal of digital transformation is to make people happier, and the country is becoming more and more prosperous.
Prime Minister Fan Mingzheng asked governments at all levels and organs and enterprises at all levels to increase leadership and guidance in the development of digital technology, raise awareness of digital transformation, continue to formulate and improve the system on digital transformation, strengthen national management and promote the development of digital technology enterprises in the spirit of respect, communication, listening, active and proactive.
During the forum, Prime Minister Pham attended the award ceremony of the "Made in Vietnam" Excellent Digital Products Award in 2021 and the opening ceremony of the "Made in Vietnam" digital products exhibition.
