"Intelligent Huixiang" 2021 China International Rail Transit and Equipment Manufacturing Industry Talent Summit Opens - Scrolling News - Hunan Daily Network - Huasheng Online
Hunan Daily News, December 10 (all-media reporter Zhou Jianheng) On the 9th, the 2021 China International Rail Transit and Equipment Manufacturing Industry Talent Summit opened in Zhuzhou.
The Standing Committee of the Provincial Party Committee and the Minister of the Organization Department of the Provincial Party Committee Wang Cheng attended the launch ceremony and spoke.
Wang Cheng pointed out that holding a talent summit is an important measure to implement the spirit of the central talent work conference and the 12th party congress of the province, demonstrating Hunan's sincerity of attaching importance to talents, thirsting for talents, and making good use of talents.
Hunan's excellent tradition of knowing and loving talents, a broad platform for the development of talents, and the realization of environmental conditions for a better life have been deeply implemented in recent years to lead the development strategy of talents, taking the Furong talent action plan as traction, and building a working pattern that attracts the use of the whole chain of talents, which has become a fertile ground for talent growth achievements, a hot land for innovation and entrepreneurship, and a livable and suitable industry.
At present, Hunan is fully implementing the "three high and four new" strategic positioning and mission tasks, which will further open the door to talents, introduce better policies for talent innovation and entrepreneurship, concentrate more resources, and create better conditions, and expect outstanding talents from all walks of life to jointly gather wisdom for Hunan's high-quality development.
Changsha, Zhuzhou, Xiangtan Pavilion and Hunan Free Trade Pilot Zone pavilion were set up at the event site, and the Provincial Science and Technology Department, the Provincial Department of Industry and Information Technology, and the Provincial Human Resources and Social Affairs Department released a list of the key needs for scientific and technological innovation in advanced manufacturing-related industries, a catalogue of talent demand for talents in the intelligent manufacturing industry, and a catalogue of young talents in the intelligent manufacturing industry.
48 large enterprises such as China Railway, Zhongzhong Science and Technology have taken talents on the spot, and nearly 1,000 recent graduates and social talents of related majors have participated in the docking of talent projects.
