The Yangtze River dry stream to achieve full coverage of water green comprehensive service area - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Wuhan, December 11 (Reporter Wang Xian) Chongqing Fuling water green comprehensive service area was completed and put into operation as scheduled on the 10th, which is the 2nd water green comprehensive service area officially operated in the upper reaches of the Yangtze River after the listing and operation of Luzhou Water Green Comprehensive Service Zone in Sichuan Province on the 8th.
At this point, the water green comprehensive service area has covered the Yangtze River, middle and downstream.
Qiu Jianhua, deputy director of the transportation minister's river aviation authority, said that previously, Hubei, Hunan, Jiangxi, Anhui, Jiangsu and other provinces have built and operated 10 water green comprehensive service areas in the middle reaches and downstream of the Yangtze River, which has been recognized by the majority of crew members and played an important role in promoting the high-quality development of Yangtze River shipping.
The full coverage of water green comprehensive service area is another milestone event in the construction of green shipping in the Yangtze River, and the capacity of receiving pollutants and shipping services in the Yangtze River has been significantly improved.
According to reports, the water green comprehensive service area is an important facility to provide all-round production and life services for the majority of ships and crews to help the majority of crew members solve the problem of "difficult".
The completion and operation of the upper reaches of the Yangtze River two water green comprehensive service areas, set life services, production services and government services as one, with green environmental protection as the theme, to ship maintenance and ship emergency rescue services as the characteristics, to realize the port of the ship "a berth, a number of services", will make the perennial sailing in the Yangtze River crew work more efficient, more convenient life.
The U.S. three aircraft carriers gathered around China's most powerful weapons rare visit to Guam 2022-01-17 multi-dimensional reports: the latest news on Sino-US relations: the latest satellite images show that the United States three aircraft carriers are gathering around China; U.S. media also disclosed that one of the most powerful weapons in the U.S. Navy's arsenal rarely visited Guam, sending an important signal to U.S. allies and adversaries in the Indo-Pacific region.
According to the Chinese think tank "South China Sea strategic situation perception platform" news, on January 9, the satellite found the U.S. "USS Carl Vinson" aircraft carrier near the Barabak Strait.
The Barabak Strait connects the South China Sea and the Sulu Sea, which is a strategic place on the first island chain in the Western Pacific Ocean.
The platform is expected to be deployed by the Carl Vinson in the South China Sea.
This is the first time that the USS Carl Vinson has been deployed with F-35C fighters and CMV-22 Osprey carrier-based transport aircraft.
The U.S. aircraft carrier, which is now advancing in the upper reaches of the Pacific Ocean, in addition to the "Carl Vinson", there is the USS Abraham Lincoln aircraft carrier departing from the United States on January 3.
For the first time, Lincoln also carried the F-35C Squadron, which was part of the U.S. Marine Corps’ 314th Fighter Attack Squadron.
In addition to the above two aircraft carriers, the U.S. Navy is currently deployed in the Asia-Pacific region with the USS Ronald Reagan aircraft carrier docked in Yokosuka, Japan.
The aircraft carrier battle group also includes the "Lake Champlain" missile cruiser, "Stokdar" missile destroyers and so on.
On January 17, 2022, the "South China Sea Strategic Situational Awareness Platform" released the latest satellite images, indicating that three U.S. aircraft carriers are gathering around China.
(Weibo @ South China Sea Strategic Situational Awareness) The U.S. three aircraft carriers gathered around China with the most powerful weapons rare visit to Guam on January 17, 2022, U.S. Navy carrier CMV-22B flight route.
(Weibo @South China Sea Strategic Situational Awareness) According to CNN on January 17, one of the most powerful weapons in the U.S. Navy's arsenal made a rare visit to Guam over the weekend.
USS Nevada, an Ohio-class nuclear submarine carrying 20 Trident ballistic missiles and dozens of nuclear warheads, sailed into the U.S. Naval Base in Guam on Saturday, January 15.
According to a rare visit to Guam, the most powerful weapon around China, the U.S. three aircraft carriers have sent a signal to allies and foes in an increasingly tense situation in the Indo-Pacific region.
It’s U.S. ballistic missile submarine’s first visit to Guam since 2016 and its second public visit to Guam since the 1980s.
The U.S. three aircraft carriers have gathered around China for the most powerful weapons to rarely visit Guam, and China has built a large number of military facilities in the Nansha Islands in recent years.
Pictured is China's Yongshu Island in the Nansha Islands.
The U.S. U.S. Navy said in a statement that the visit of the Ohio-class nuclear submarine Nevada to Guam has strengthened cooperation between the United States and its allies in the region, demonstrating U.S. capabilities, flexibility, operational readiness, and continued commitment to security and stability in the Indo-Pacific region.
Ballistic missile submarines are often referred to as “Boomer submarines.”
The whereabouts of the 14 Lightning Submarines in the U.S. Navy fleet are usually kept strictly confidential.
Surrounding the secrets of ballistic missile submarines, the "Raise Submarine" has become "the most important survival weapon in the nuclear triad", which also includes silo ballistic missiles located in the continental United States, as well as bombers such as the B-2 and B-52, which can carry nuclear warheads.
Talking to friends about Meta's recent decline of 26%, the market capitalization evaporated $251 billion, Zuckerberg responded "in the face of unprecedented competition", why?
Meta (formerly Facebook) is actually an advertising company, the revenue comes mainly from advertising, today's money-making advertising companies, they have a traffic channel.
Facebook, Instagram, Whatsapp, etc., no matter what kind of functional positioning, it is Meta's traffic channel.
Not only that, Meta is also the largest "ad alliance", and many app's external Meta ads are realized through Meta's advertising platform.
However, times have changed.
First, due to the adjustment of Apple's privacy policy, it is difficult for Meta to obtain the user's data information, which affects the efficiency of advertising.
Apple's current privacy policy is user-friendly and will obviously prompt users whether to allow apps to obtain their own information, and most people's normal response is definitely not allowed.
Next, if Google stabs again, the impact will be even greater on Meta’s revenue.
Second, China’s factors in Meta’s previous revenue growth have also weakened (the proportion of this factor is uncertain, but it does exist).
Everyone knows that Meta has no business in China, but this understanding is not accurate.
At least 10 percent of Meta’s revenue each year comes from China, mostly from companies that make its seafood business.
There are about a few hundred people in Meta’s offices in Hong Kong, and there are several major agents on the mainland.
Chinese companies want to expand into overseas markets, and Meta is an advertising channel, and most of the burned money goes to Meta.
What's interesting is that the TTT is one of Meta's main competitors right now, but the first two years Meta made a lot of money out of the bytes.
Various agents in China are playing advertisements in Meta, and Meta's performance in Greater China is also very good.
I haven’t learned much lately, but it’s certainly not better than before.
The stage of large-scale money-burning by Chinese companies overseas has passed.
Third, the development of new traffic channels is not smooth.
Facebook is getting older, and the new platforms, including TT, aren’t in Meta’s hands.
The biggest problem is not just the decline in revenue, but the lack of growth expectations.
The capital market not only depends on income, but more importantly depends on the expectations of the future.
It’s clear that Meta’s expectations aren’t enough.
In order to tell a new story to the market, Zuckerberg told the "metaverse".
It is true that the metaverse should be one of the directions of the future, but the realization cycle of the metaverse is relatively long, and this story should not be enough in these two or three years to support Meta's market value.
Therefore, the next two years should be a more difficult period for Meta.
Don't look at Facebook's current scenery, there are 100 billion to 200 billion U.S. dollars of revenue every year, in fact, Facebook is now a very strong sense of crisis, compared with other Internet companies and high-tech companies, there is no good safe moat.
Although some of his social software now has a higher daily life, it is also the mainstream social software, such as Facebook, WhatsApp and so on, but in the face of the rapid development of TikTok, Facebook also has no confidence, subversion between the blink of an eye.
And to engage in the metaverse of this unattainable concept, there is no hope of success in a short period of time, so Facebook is very dangerous, which is why Zuckerberg is changing the name of the company, but constantly looking for the root cause of the track, but I think his track choice is wrong, it is not the way to return the above is some of my thoughts, for reference.
Article 17 The State implements the registered practice management system for the qualification of registered fire engineers.
Those who have obtained the qualification certificate of first- and second-level registered fire engineers can practice in the name of registered fire engineers at the corresponding level.
Article 18 The fire department of the Ministry of Public Security is the registration and approval department for the qualification of registered fire engineers at the first level.
The public security organs of provinces, autonomous regions and municipalities directly under the Central Government are the registration and approval departments for the registration and approval of secondary registered fire engineers, and are responsible for the preliminary review of the qualification registration of registered fire engineers at the first level.
Article 19 Those who have obtained the qualification certificates of first- and second-level registered fire engineers and apply for registration shall be employed by an approved fire technical service agency or key fire safety unit, and shall submit registration application materials to the public security department of the public security organ of the employing unit (the employing unit belongs to the enterprise, through which the enterprise is registered with the business).
Article 20 After receiving the applicant's registration application materials, the public security agencies of provinces, autonomous regions and municipalities directly under the Central Government shall, if the application materials are incomplete or do not comply with the statutory form, shall, on the spot or within 5 working days, inform the applicant of all the contents that the applicant needs to correct, and if they do not be notified within the time limit, it shall be accepted from the date of receipt of the application materials.
Applications for registration that are accepted or inadmissible shall be issued with the special seal of the fire protection agency of the public security organs at this level and the written certificate dated.
21st provinces, autonomous regions and municipalities directly under the public security organs of the public security organs from 20 working days from the date of acceptance of the application for registration, in accordance with the prescribed conditions and procedures to complete the first-level registered fire engineer qualification application materials and the registration and approval of the second-level registered fire engineer qualification, and the first-level registered fire engineer qualification application materials and preliminary examination opinions submitted to the Ministry of Public Security Fire Department for examination and approval.
The fire department of the Ministry of Public Security shall, within 20 working days from the date of receiving the application materials and preliminary examination opinions submitted by the fire department of the provincial public security organs, make a decision on whether to approve it within 20 working days.
If it is not possible to make an approval decision within the prescribed time limit, the extension period and reasons shall be communicated to the applicant.
If a decision is made without approval, the reasons shall be stated in writing, and the applicant shall be informed that the applicant has the right to apply for administrative reconsideration or file an administrative lawsuit in accordance with law.
22nd registration and approval departments shall, within 10 working days from the date of making the approval decision, issued and served to the corresponding level of the registration certificate.
Article 23 Each registration certificate is valid for three years.
The registration certificate is the practice certificate of the registered fire engineer at the corresponding level during the validity period, which is kept and used by the registered fire engineer himself.
Article 24 Where an application for initial registration occurs, an application shall be made within one year from the date of obtaining the qualification certificate of a first- or second-level registered fire engineer.
When applying for initial registration, it is necessary to comply with the continuing education requirements of these provisions.
Specific measures for registration management such as initial registration, continuous registration, change registration, cancellation of registration and non-registration shall be stipulated separately by the Ministry of Public Security.
Article 25 Continuing education is a necessary condition for the continuous registration, re-registration and overdue initial registration of registered fire engineers.
During the validity period of each registration, the registered fire engineers at all levels shall complete the corresponding continuing education in accordance with the regulations.
Article 26 The registration and approval department shall, in a timely manner, announce to the society the registration of fire engineers, establish the integrity file of registered fire engineers, and implement credit management for their practice activities.
Article 27 The registered administrative departments with the qualifications of registered fire engineers at all levels shall strictly implement the relevant provisions of the Administrative Licensing Law of the People's Republic of China.
